[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12841.83, "timestamp": "03:34:01", "text": "[清嗓子]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12856.95, "timestamp": "03:34:16", "text": "哦，我停下来了。 嗯，好的。 等待。 对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12861.11, "timestamp": "03:34:21", "text": "呃，游戏。 跳过故事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12864.15, "timestamp": "03:34:24", "text": "哦，这些孩子。 你为什么要欺负这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12866.79, "timestamp": "03:34:26", "text": "孩子？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12874.469, "timestamp": "03:34:34", "text": "好的。 我最近迷上了热"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12877.269, "timestamp": "03:34:37", "text": "巧克力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12881.429, "timestamp": "03:34:41", "text": "我从来没吃过巧克力。 热巧克力。 我经常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12886.79, "timestamp": "03:34:46", "text": "在电影、视频之类的东西里看到它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12890.469, "timestamp": "03:34:50", "text": "等等，我从来没遇到过这种情况。 嗯？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12892.71, "timestamp": "03:34:52", "text": "你们有吗？哦，有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12894.55, "timestamp": "03:34:54", "text": "罗林斯去世了。 你刚才提到了热"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12896.433, "timestamp": "03:34:56", "text": "巧克力，所以你肯定喝过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12897.349, "timestamp": "03:34:57", "text": "[笑声]"}]